Lemma 15: f(f(f(X, f(f(Y, Y), f(Y, Y))), f(f(f(Y, Y), f(Y, Y)), f(f(Y, Y), f(Y, Y)))), f(f(Y, Y), f(Y, Y))) = f(f(Y, Y), f(f(Y, Y), f(Y, Y))).
